WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.096 --> 00:00:00.746
- Hello

00:00:00.746 --> 00:00:01.519
- Hello

00:00:01.519 --> 00:00:02.595
- [Girl] We're gonna talk
- [Boy] We're gonna talk

00:00:02.595 --> 00:00:05.074
- [Girl] about black history
- [Boy] about black history

00:00:05.074 --> 00:00:08.900
(triumphant music)

00:00:13.180 --> 00:00:15.172
- Harriet Tubman, she's just my hero,

00:00:15.172 --> 00:00:17.325
she helped everyone out
when they needed it.

00:00:17.325 --> 00:00:19.194
And she just saved everyone.

00:00:19.194 --> 00:00:20.698
She snuck them out

00:00:20.698 --> 00:00:22.425
and she used the big dipper

00:00:22.425 --> 00:00:24.131
and freed eveyone.

00:00:24.131 --> 00:00:25.655
Let's go, we will be free,

00:00:25.655 --> 00:00:27.524
we'll just go at night with all of you

00:00:27.524 --> 00:00:30.125
and go to the underground railroad,

00:00:30.125 --> 00:00:31.892
and we'll go, be free,

00:00:31.892 --> 00:00:33.260
and go together.

00:00:33.260 --> 00:00:36.629
- [Voiceover] Thank you so
much, I really want to leave.

00:00:36.629 --> 00:00:38.986
I don't know how long I could stay here,

00:00:38.986 --> 00:00:39.982
but thank you so much,

00:00:39.982 --> 00:00:42.724
you are a hero to us all.

00:00:42.724 --> 00:00:44.512
- [Voiceover] We shall be free, let's go.

00:00:44.512 --> 00:00:47.113
- Hey Journey, what was
life for the black people

00:00:47.113 --> 00:00:48.303
back in the day?

00:00:48.303 --> 00:00:50.498
- Well, it would be certain sections

00:00:50.498 --> 00:00:52.631
where they would have to be able to sit.

00:00:52.631 --> 00:00:54.557
- [Voiceover] Lady, you can't sit here!

00:00:54.557 --> 00:00:56.445
- [Voiceover] Oh yeah?

00:00:56.445 --> 00:00:58.620
- [Voiceover] Yeah!

00:00:58.620 --> 00:01:01.647
- [Voiceover] You don't say that.

00:01:01.647 --> 00:01:04.044
- You don't tell me what to do either.

00:01:04.044 --> 00:01:06.463
Cause this is my bus,

00:01:06.463 --> 00:01:09.226
Rosa Parks.

00:01:09.226 --> 00:01:11.339
- [Voiceover] You are going to jail.

00:01:11.339 --> 00:01:12.841
- [Voiceover] I don't care!

00:01:12.841 --> 00:01:15.808
Some white people go to jail too.

00:01:15.808 --> 00:01:17.833
- [Voiceover] Yeah, like, nobody.

00:01:17.833 --> 00:01:19.763
Hello, cops, yes,

00:01:19.763 --> 00:01:20.617
I am here,

00:01:20.617 --> 00:01:22.566
and this black person won't leave

00:01:22.566 --> 00:01:24.558
and just come here in
five minutes, please,

00:01:24.558 --> 00:01:25.403
thank you.

00:01:25.403 --> 00:01:28.247
- It is the right that black people

00:01:28.247 --> 00:01:32.128
should sit in the front of the bus too.

00:01:32.128 --> 00:01:34.037
- Martin Luther King Jr.

00:01:34.037 --> 00:01:36.577
he's best known for advancing
the Civil Rights movement

00:01:36.577 --> 00:01:38.457
and the I Have a Dream speech.

00:01:38.457 --> 00:01:41.770
- It talked about getting
whites and blacks together

00:01:41.770 --> 00:01:44.268
and making it a better place.

00:01:44.268 --> 00:01:46.869
I have a dream that brothers and sisters

00:01:46.869 --> 00:01:48.352
would unite.

00:01:48.352 --> 00:01:49.733
There would be no more wars,

00:01:49.733 --> 00:01:51.033
no more killing,

00:01:51.033 --> 00:01:55.336
we would all have the
same equal education,

00:01:55.336 --> 00:01:57.442
equal opportunity,

00:01:57.442 --> 00:02:00.896
and we'd unite as one.

00:02:00.896 --> 00:02:03.496
Malcolm X was a Civil Rights activist

00:02:03.496 --> 00:02:06.950
and he was a spokesman
for the nation of Islam.

00:02:06.950 --> 00:02:09.835
He believed to use the method of

00:02:09.835 --> 00:02:13.269
by any means necessary.

00:02:13.269 --> 00:02:15.057
- He changed his beliefs

00:02:15.057 --> 00:02:18.043
and he just wanted us
to be together in peace,

00:02:18.043 --> 00:02:21.172
just as Martin Luther King wanted.

00:02:21.172 --> 00:02:24.687
So basically all black historic figures

00:02:24.687 --> 00:02:28.019
are, in some way, the same

00:02:28.019 --> 00:02:30.620
because they all wanted the same thing,

00:02:30.620 --> 00:02:33.409
for us to come together in peace.

00:02:38.909 --> 00:02:40.209
(whoosh)

00:02:40.209 --> 00:02:41.780
(creak)

